          "team": "t1",
          "brief": "What would you write or record for this task?\n\n\n### The situation\nIt is a busy evening at Aranya Grand Hotels. A guest, Mr. Arjun Pillai in Room 506, sent a message through the hotel app: 'The air conditioning has been making a loud rattling noise since last night. I have a meeting call at 6 am tomorrow and I need silence. Please fix this tonight or move me.'\n\nYou ask the AI assistant to draft a reply. It produces this:\n\n'Dear Mr. Pillai, we sincerely apologise for the inconvenience. Our engineering team will have the air conditioning fully repaired by 10 pm tonight. If the issue persists, we will move you to another room at no charge. Thank you for your patience.'\n\nThe engineering team finished their shift at 8 pm. It is 8:45 pm now. Nobody is on call tonight. You cannot promise a repair by 10 pm. The room-move offer is real and you can do that.\n\n### Details to use\nPriya is at the desk and available. Type the reply you will actually send to Mr. Pillai. You may use part of the AI draft. Remove whatever you cannot deliver. Keep whatever is true.",
          "title": "AI Draft, Wrong Promise",
          "answer": "artefact",
          "easier": "The brief tells them directly that engineering has gone home — they only have to spot the bad promise in the draft.",
          "fields": [
            "The message you send to Mr. Pillai"
          ],
          "harder": "Mr. Pillai has also asked for a complimentary breakfast as compensation. They must decide whether to offer it, and the reply must handle all three things: the repair, the move, and breakfast.",
          "minutes": 4,
          "support": "assistant",
          "criteria": [
            "Removes the 10 pm repair promise — it is not possible tonight",
            "Keeps the room-move offer because it is real and addresses Mr. Pillai's actual concern",
            "Does not copy and send the AI draft unchanged",
            "Reply is warm and specific to Mr. Pillai's 6 am meeting — not a generic apology"
          ],
          "measures": [
            "Customer care",
            "Clear communication",
            "Composure under pressure",
            "Follow-through"
          ],
          "needsImage": false
        },
