          "id": "t1s020",
          "day": "3",
          "team": "t1",
          "brief": "Write the corrected message you would actually send.\n\n### The situation\nThe front desk supervisor has asked you to send a short upsell message to four guests who are checking in this afternoon. All four have booked Standard rooms. The hotel is running a same-day upgrade offer: guests can move to a Deluxe room for an extra ₹800 per night, or to a Junior Suite for an extra ₹1,500 per night. Their stays are all one night.\n\nYou use the AI assistant to draft the message. You type: 'Write a short, friendly upsell message for guests arriving today. Standard room booked. Upgrade to Deluxe for ₹800 extra or Junior Suite for ₹1,500 extra. One-night stay.'\n\nThe assistant returns this:\n\n---\nDear Guest,\n\nWelcome to Aranya Grand Hotels! We are delighted to have you with us today.\n\n### Details to use\nAs a special same-day offer, we would love to make your stay even more comfortable. You can upgrade to our spacious Deluxe Room for just ₹600 extra, or treat yourself to our Junior Suite for ₹1,500 — a truly memorable experience.\n\nSimply let us know at check-in and we will take care of everything.\n\nWarm regards,\nAranya Grand Hotels\n---\n\nDecide what to do with this draft before you send it to the four guests.\n\n### Your response\nThen, in one sentence, say what error the AI made and why it matters for a guest reading this at check-in.",
