          "brief": "What would you say in this situation?\n\n\n### The situation\nYou are at the Centurion Mall Group information kiosk. A guest, Mr. Farhan Shaikh, stops and says he is looking for a gift for his wife's birthday — budget around ₹3,000 — and asks if you can suggest anything in the mall. You know the mall has a promotion running: Aura Jewellery on Level 2 has a 'Buy ₹2,500, get a free gift-wrap and complimentary card' offer until Sunday.\n\nYou decide to use the AI assistant to draft a quick spoken reply you can personalise and say out loud. You type: 'A guest wants a birthday gift for his wife, budget ₹3,000. We have an offer at Aura Jewellery — spend ₹2,500 and get free gift-wrap and a card. Write me a short friendly reply I can say to him.'\n\nThe assistant returns:\n\n### Details to use\n'Sir, I would strongly recommend that you immediately proceed to Aura Jewellery on Level 2. They are currently running an exclusive limited-time promotion where any purchase above ₹2,500 includes complimentary gift-wrapping and a greeting card, absolutely free of charge. This is an unmissable opportunity and I guarantee you your wife will love it. Aura is the best jewellery store in the mall. Please do not miss this chance.'\n\nMr. Farhan is still standing in front of you, waiting. You have about fifteen seconds to decide what to say.\n\n### Your response\nIdentify what is wrong with the assistant's draft and then speak your actual reply to Mr. Farhan — as if he is right there. Record your spoken response (sixty seconds or less).",
