          "criteria": [
            "Correctly identifies conversions (4 of 8, needing 4 more on Friday alone) as the hardest gap to close in one day",
            "Notes that Wednesday had 6 calls and 1 meeting but 0 conversions and 0 value – suggesting calls were made but not converted, which is a pattern worth examining",
            "Friday plan includes a specific action tied to closing conversions – for example, prioritising warm leads or customers already in discussion – not just 'work harder'",
            "Uses the actual numbers from the table rather than vague language"
          ],
          "measures": [
