          "brief": "What would you do in this situation?\n\n\n### The situation\nAt Shipkart, every bag of parcels that comes off the inbound conveyor is scanned and the count goes into the WMS (Warehouse Management System). The system count and the physical count should match exactly.\n\nThis morning, the WMS screen for Bay 3 shows:\n\nBag ID 7741 — scanned in: 24 parcels\nBag ID 7742 — scanned in: 18 parcels\nBag ID 7743 — scanned in: 31 parcels\nBag ID 7744 — scanned in: 22 parcels\n\nTotal in system: 95 parcels\n\nYou walk to Bay 3 and physically count the parcels in front of you. You count 89.\n\nRajan is at his desk. You ask the AI assistant to help you write a note for the system log. It drafts:\n\n'Bay 3 recount complete. Minor variance of 6 units noted. Likely caused by scanning error at intake. Record corrected to 89.'\n\n### Details to use\nDo not send this note. Identify two specific problems with the AI's draft, then write a corrected version of the note yourself — four to six sentences — that you would actually enter into the system log.",
