          "title": "Update the Ticket Before You Go",
          "answer": "typed",
          "easier": "Give the student a sentence starter: 'Parcel for Mehta Textiles is currently in…' and ask them to complete the note.",
          "fields": [],
          "harder": "Tell the student that Shalini has gone off shift and cannot be reached, and that the ticket has no customer phone number. They must also add a line saying what information is missing and who should find it.",
          "minutes": 3,
