          "team": "t3",
          "brief": "Read the draft carefully.\n\n### The situation\nPriya asks you to reply to a customer complaint that came in by email this morning. The customer, Mr. Rajan Pillai, says his parcel has not arrived. It was due yesterday. He wants to know where it is and when it will arrive.\n\nYou check FlowDesk. The parcel is showing 'In transit — delayed, weather'. There is no confirmed new delivery date yet.\n\nYou open the AI assistant and type: 'Write a reply to a customer whose parcel is one day late due to weather. He wants to know when it will arrive.'\n\nThe assistant produces this draft:\n\n'Dear Mr. Pillai, Thank you for writing to us. We sincerely apologise for the delay. Your parcel was held up due to adverse weather conditions. We are pleased to confirm it will be delivered to you tomorrow by 6 PM. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you need anything further. Warm regards, SwiftMove Express.'\n\n### Your response\nThere is one thing in it that SwiftMove Express cannot actually promise right now. Rewrite the reply so it is honest, still polite, and tells Mr. Pillai what you do know.",
          "title": "The AI Draft Promises Too Much",
