          "brief": "Type your response: state what you found, what you would change, and whether you would send the corrected version immediately or check with anyone first.\n\n### The situation\nIt is day fourteen. A key customer, Jio Infrastructure Projects, has emailed asking for their weekly dispatch summary. ConnectCore Supply Chain sends these every Friday. You have used the AI assistant to draft the reply.\n\nHere is the dispatch data from the system for this week:\n\nJio account — orders received: 18\nDispatched on time: 15\nDispatched late: 2\nStill pending: 1\nOn-time rate: 83%\n\nHere is the draft the AI assistant produced:\n\n---\nDear Jio Infrastructure Projects team,\n\nPlease find your weekly dispatch summary for the ConnectCore Supply Chain hub.\n\nOrders received this week: 18\nDispatched on time: 15\nDispatched late: 2\nStill pending: 1\nOn-time rate: 88%\n\nWe remain committed to improving your on-time rate and will follow up on the pending order by Monday.\n\nWarm regards,\nHub Supervisor, ConnectCore Supply Chain\n---\n\n### Details to use\nYou will send this. Read it against the data.",
