          "fields": [
            "Your tracker row (Date | Caller name | Department | Issue | Action taken | Status | Assigned to)"
          ],
          "harder": "Mrs Rathi also mentioned this is the third time in two months she has had equipment issues — they must decide whether to note that pattern somewhere in the record.",
