          "brief": "What do you update in the system immediately, and what do you do about the customer while your manager is in the meeting?\n\n### The situation\nShopnest India's tracker shows order #SN-5102 as Delivered - the courier partner updated the status at 11:14 am today. But at 2:30 pm you receive a message from the customer: 'Your website says delivered but I am sitting at home and nothing has arrived. My neighbour also did not receive it.'\n\nYou call the courier's customer line. The agent tells you the driver marked it delivered but the proof-of-delivery photo in their system shows a doorstep that does not match the address - it looks like a different building entirely.\n\nYour manager is in a meeting until 4 pm.\n\nThe system right now shows: Status - Delivered. Closure note - 'Delivered at 11:14 am, POD uploaded.'\n\nYou cannot process a reshipment yourself - that needs manager approval. But you can update the ticket.\n\nPriya is not available right now - she is on a call.",
