          "brief": "What do you do, in what order, and what do you record in the ticket?\n\n### The situation\nEvery morning at Shopnest India, the Operations Coordinator checks the open ticket queue. Today you are looking at the queue and you see this row:\n\nTicket ID: SN-4830 | Customer: Meena Rao | Issue: Wrong item delivered - requested exchange | Status: Open | Assigned to: Rohan | Last updated: 6 days ago\n\nThere are no notes in the ticket after the original complaint. Rohan left the team nine days ago - you heard about this in a team meeting.\n\nThe customer has not written again. The exchange window in Shopnest policy is 10 days from delivery. You do not know when the item was delivered.\n\nYou have access to the order tracker, which shows: Order #SN-4830 delivered 8 days ago.\n\nThat means the customer has 2 days left to exchange.\n\nYour manager is at her desk.",
          "title": "A ticket has been sitting open for six days with no owner",
