          "team": "t1",
          "brief": "Speak your response out loud for up to sixty seconds, as if Deepa is on the line.\n\n### The situation\nYou are on the phone with Deepa Nair. She bought a ₹3,800 non-stick cookware set from Shopnest India twelve days ago. The return window is fourteen days. She says the coating is peeling already and she wants her money back today, not store credit. Before the call you asked the AI assistant: 'What should I say to a customer who wants a return for a defective product inside the return window?' It replied: 'Inform the customer that manufacturing defects are covered under the seller's warranty and they should contact the seller directly. Shopnest India does not handle warranty claims.'\n\n### Details to use\nThat answer is wrong for this situation. Shopnest India's policy (from the internal handbook Priya walked you through in Week 2) says that if a defect is reported within the return window, Shopnest India processes the return directly — the customer does not go to the seller. The AI has confused post-window warranty claims with in-window defect returns.\n\nDeepa is already annoyed. If you follow the AI's script and redirect her to the seller, she will almost certainly cancel her account.\n\n### Your response\nYour response should: acknowledge her frustration, tell her what Shopnest India will actually do (process the return directly, refund within 5–7 business days to her original payment method), and leave the door open for her to stay a customer — for example by mentioning that you will personally follow up once the refund is confirmed. Do not read from a script; talk to her.",
          "title": "Turn an angry caller into a kept customer",
          "answer": "spoken",
          "easier": "Give the student the correct policy sentence in writing before they speak, so they only need to handle the tone and delivery.",
          "fields": [],
          "harder": "Add a second objection mid-scene: Deepa says she paid partly with a Shopnest voucher and wants that portion back as cash, not re-credited — the student must handle that wrinkle without preparation.",
          "minutes": 3,
          "support": "assistant",
          "measures": [
            "Does not follow the AI's incorrect advice to redirect Deepa to the seller",
            "States the correct policy — Shopnest India handles the return directly inside the window",
            "Gives a concrete next step (refund timeline, personal follow-up) rather than vague reassurance",
            "Tone stays calm and warm even when the customer is hostile",
            "Uses the sixty seconds to keep the relationship, not just close the complaint"
          ],
          "needsImage": false
        },
